```
- C# event `EventHandler<string>` okay.
- `UpdateConfig` lock; set config; call `Wake`.
- `Start`: if thread null, create `Thread(Run)`, IsBackground true, Name, Start.
- `Stop`: `_stopping=true; _wake.Set(); thread.Join(3000)`.
- `TriggerLogin`: `_wake.Set()`.
- `Run`:
```
Log.Info("登录服务启动，门户=" + _config.PortalUrl + "，用户=" + Mask(_config.Username));
while (!_stopping) {
  AppConfig cfg = GetConfig();
  if (cfg == null || !cfg.HasCredentials) { SetState(NeedsSetup,...); Wait(30); continue; }
  OnlineCheckResult check = OnlineChecker.Check(cfg.PortalUrl);
  if (_stopping) break;
  if (check.Online) { SetState(Online, "网络已连接"); Wait(cfg.CheckIntervalSeconds); continue; }
  if (!check.NetworkReady) { SetState(WaitingNetwork, "等待网络连接..."); Wait(10); continue; }
  SetState(LoggingIn, "正在登录校园网...");
  PortalClient client = new PortalClient(cfg);
  LoginResult res = client.Login(cfg.Username, cfg.Password);
  if (_stopping) break;
  if (res.Success) {
    bool online = WaitForOnline(12);
    if (online) {
      cfg.LastSuccess = DateTime.Now.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss");
      if (client.ApiVersion != cfg.ApiVersion) { cfg.ApiVersion = client.ApiVersion; }
      cfg.Save();
      SetState(Online, "登录成功，网络已连接");
      Notify("校园网已连接");
      Wait(cfg.CheckIntervalSeconds);
    } else {
      SetState(Error, "认证成功，但网络尚未恢复");
      NotifyOnce("认证成功但网络未恢复，请检查网络");
      Wait(cfg.RetryIntervalSeconds);
    }
  } else {
    string msg = res.Message;
    SetState(Error, msg);
    NotifyOnce("登录失败：" + msg);
    Wait(cfg.RetryIntervalSeconds);
  }
}
```
- `WaitForOnline`: loops 6 times 2s, calls `OnlineChecker.Check`, if online return true. This can be 12s.
- `SetState`: compare `_lastState`/message; raise event.
- `MaskUsername`: first 3 + "****" + last 4 if length > 7; else "***".
- `NotifyOnce`: throttle 10 min; but on first failure immediately. Use `_lastNotify`.
- If error message changes, notify maybe. `NotifyOnce` with key? Simpler:
```
if (DateTime.Now - _lastNotify > TimeSpan.FromMinutes(10)) { _lastNotify=now; raise; }
```
- On success, always notify if previous state != Online.
- `Wait`:
```
private bool Wait(int seconds) {
  if (_stopping) return false;
  _wake.WaitOne(seconds*1000, false);
  _wake.Reset();
  return !_stopping;
}
```
- `TriggerLogin` while online: `_wake` causes loop; it sees online and sleeps again. To force, add `_force`:
```
private volatile bool _force;
public void TriggerLogin() { _force = true; _wake.Set(); }
```
In loop, if `_force` and online, skip online branch once:
```
bool force = _force; _force = false;
OnlineCheckResult check = ...;
if (check.Online && !force) ...
if (force && check.Online) { SetState(Online, "当前已在线"); ... } 
```
Manual "立即登录" should not log in if online; show status. Better not force. `TriggerLogin` just wakes; if online, it reports online. That's fine.
- Could add `ForceRelogin` not needed.

- `SetState` event with state and message; tray updates.
- `Notification` event with message; tray shows balloon.

`UpdateConfig`:
- `lock(_sync) { _config = cfg.Clone(); }`; `_wake.Set()`.
- If credentials changed, reset error.
- `GetConfig` locks and returns clone.

`Dispose` stops.

Need ensure `cfg.Password` is set from DPAPI. `AppConfig.Load` does. If `PasswordError` non-empty, `HasCredentials` false? `PasswordProtected` non-empty, `Username` non-empty -> true even if decryption failed; Password empty -> login with empty -> fail. Settings should prompt. In Program, if `PasswordError` non-empty, show settings. Add `HasCredentials` check `!string.IsNullOrEmpty(Password)` rather than PasswordProtected. But `Password` may not be decrypted until Load; Load calls TryUnprotect. Set `HasCredentials` to require Password non-empty. If config manually has PasswordProtected but no current Password, Load decrypts. Good. Change.

Also `SetPassword` with empty clears; settings if blank should keep existing. We'll handle.

Let's update `HasCredentials`.

